If the option \u8220\'93C Programming Libraries\u8221\'94 is selected in the installer, the environment variable \u8220\'93SMARPOD_SDK\u8221\'94 is added to the system environment. The environment variable can be added to header and library search paths in development tools. }
\par \pard\plain \s47\rtlch\af20\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af7\loch\sl288\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\faauto\fi-210\li345\lin345\sb0\sa51\ltrpar\cf1\f7\fs16\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af15\langfe1081\sl288\slmult1\fi-210\li345\lin345\ri0\rin0{\loch\lang1025\loch
Bugfix: if a move command was started with parameter waitForCompletion = 1, other move commands could be started (from other threads) while the first command was waiting for completion. Sometimes the first command would not return to the caller and hang forever. Now, when a wait-for-completion movement is executed and another move command is called, the second call will return with the new error SMARPOD_MOVING_ERROR. It is possible (and safe) to overwrite move commands that do not wait for completion (waitForCompletion = 0) by other move commands.}
