\line }{\loch\lang1025\loch
The SmarPod software was modified so that the positioners of newer versions of SmarPod 150.57 SC (january 2013+) are centered when the SmarPod is in the zero-pose. The positioners of older versions of the 10010 SmarPod (mid 2012) are not centered anymore in zero-pose when controlled with SmarPod software 2.3.5 and higher! (It is possible to correct this by setting special tuning parameters in the MCS controller \u8211\'96 if you wish to do this please contact SmarAct GmbH).}
