\par \pard\plain \s47\rtlch\af20\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af7\loch\sl288\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\faauto\fi-210\li345\lin345\sb0\sa51\ltrpar\cf1\f7\fs16\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af15\langfe1081\sl288\slmult1\fi-210\li345\lin345\ri0\rin0{\loch\lang1025\loch
The function of the "Activate" button for pivot points has changed: When changing the pivot and pushing "Activate", the physical pose of the SmarPod is reinterpreted based on the new pivot point and written in the offset and rotation angle fields. The SmarPod does not move anymore when "Activate" is pushed.}
