\line }{\loch\lang1025\loch
Function Smarpod_Initialize checks the configuration of the MCS. If the configuration does not satisfy the required configuration for }{\loch\lang1025\loch
{\*\bkmkend __DdeLink__38592_1413435448}the SmarPod model, Smarpod_Initialize returns with the new error code SMARPOD_SYSTEM_CONFIGURATION_ERROR. In this case the initialization has not failed but some commands will return with the same error code. Please read the description in the SmarPod Programmer's Guide}{\dbch\langfe1025\loch
.}
\par \pard\plain \s47\rtlch\af20\afs24\alang1081 \ltrch\lang1033\langfe1081\hich\af7\loch\sl288\slmult1\ql\nowidctlpar\hyphpar0\faauto\fi-210\li345\lin345\sb0\sa51\ltrpar\cf1\f7\fs16\lang1033\kerning1\dbch\af15\langfe1081\sl288\slmult1\fi-210\li345\lin345\ri0\rin0{\loch\lang1025\loch
